3-Bedroom Apartment in Caldelas, Guimarães

Excellent 3-bedroom apartment located in Caldelas, Guimarães, in a quiet residential area that is nonetheless well served by all types of amenities. The property features a balcony, ideal for outdoor relaxation and enjoying natural light.

With a functional and well-distributed layout, this apartment comprises three bedrooms, a spacious living room, a kitchen, and 2 full bathrooms, ensuring comfort for the whole family.

Location is one of this property's greatest strengths: it is situated in a prime residential area, with easy access to local shops, various services, schools, and other essential everyday amenities. It also benefits from good road access, making it easy to travel to Guimarães, Braga, and the rest of the Minho region.

